#- Find out more about the client and go after him (from either the doc or grim)
#  - to kill him - POSSIBLE
#  - to get more payment
#  - to intimidate him into leaving the Doc alone
#  - to steal money from him - POSSIBLE

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('jacob_backed_off')
goto: BackedOff

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Wait, I recognize you. You're the contractor I hired.
+ What the hell are *you* doing here?
#
o_text: I'm here to collect my reward.
o_id: collect_reward
o_cond: !HasFlag('ClientRewardReceived(starter)')
o_goto: CollectPayment
#
o_text: I'm here to renegotiate the terms of our contract.
o_id: renegotiate
o_goto: NegotiateContract
#
o_text: I represent some bigger third party. You better listen carefully now.
o_id: corporate_armed
o_cond: HasOutfit('business') && HasVisibleWeapon()
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: CorporateSuccess
o_fail: CorporateFail
#
o_text: I represent some bigger third party. You better listen carefully now.
o_id: corporate_unarmed
o_cond: HasOutfit('business') && !HasVisibleWeapon()
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: CorporateSuccess
o_fail: CorporateFail
#
o_text: You'll leave the Ripperdoc alone, is that clear?
o_id: intimidate
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Hard')
o_succ: IntimidateSuccess
o_fail: IntimidateFail
#
o_text: I've got a bullet with your name on it.
o_id: bullet_easy
o_cond: HasFlag('took_single_round') && !HasFlag('PlayerKillCount')
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: IntimidateSuccess
o_fail: IntimidateFail
#
o_text: I've got a bullet with your name on it.
o_id: bullet_hard
o_cond: HasFlag('took_single_round') && HasFlag('PlayerKillCount')
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Hard')
o_succ: IntimidateSuccess
o_fail: IntimidateFail
#
o_text: Nothing. Just checking in.
o_id: leave
o_goto: End

name: IntimidateSuccess
npc: (He looks scared.) Okay, okay. I'll leave the Ripperdoc alone.
+ If that's what you want, I'll call off the job.
effect: SetFlag('jacob_backed_off')
#
o_text: You've got guts, at least. Got any real work for someone like me?
o_id: ask_real_work
o_cond: HasFlag('PlayerKillCount')
o_goto: BetterJob
#
o_text: You're damn right you will.
o_id: damn_right
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction
#
o_text: You know what? I have to be sure. A bullet to your forehead should do the trick.
o_id: kill_anyway
o_goto: KillClient

name: IntimidateFail
npc: You piece of shit. You think you can intimidate me?
+ I am going to rip you apart, choomba.
#
o_text: <Fight>
o_id: fight
o_cond: !HasFlag('PlayerKillCount')
o_goto: KillClient
#
o_text: <Fight>
o_cond: HasFlag('PlayerKillCount')
o_goto: CallGoons

name: CallGoons
npc: I heard about you. That's why I didn't come alone. BOYS!
effect: ProvokeFaction('jacob')
effect: StartCombat

name: KillClient
npc: Fine, come at me, bro.
effect: StartCombat

name: CollectPayment
npc: I was told to use the dead drop? I am not sure why you are here.
+ But ok, let's go with it. So, did you get my money?
#
o_text: Sure, it's right here.
o_id: pay_jacob
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 250)
o_goto: GiveMoney
#
o_text: Not yet, still working on it.
o_id: not_yet
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: GiveMoney
npc: (He takes the cash, eyes gleaming with greed.)
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 250)
effect: PlayerAddItem('binge(3)')
effect: SetFlag('ClientRewardReceived(starter)')
npc: Well, well, looks like you're not completely useless after all.
+ Now, I trust you’ll get out of my sight.
#
o_text: I'm done with you. Don’t forget our deal.
o_id: done_with_you
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction
#
o_text: This better buy me some loyalty, or I’ll be back.
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: NegotiateContract
npc: Renegotiate? (He raises an eyebrow, skeptical.)
npc: The deal was already set. What makes you think you deserve more?
+ I’m not in the habit of paying twice.
#
o_text: The risk was higher than expected. I want double.
o_id: want_double
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: NegotiateSuccess
o_fail: NegotiateFail
#
o_text: I know your dirty secrets. Pay up, or I spill them all.
o_id: dirty_secrets
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: NegotiateSuccess
o_fail: NegotiateFail
#
o_text: Fine, let’s call it even. I’ll take the original payment.
o_id: call_it_even
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: NegotiateSuccess
npc: (He sighs, clearly annoyed but willing to concede.)
npc: Fine. You drive a hard bargain. Here, take it, but don’t expect any favors next time.
+ You better not screw me over.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 250)
effect: SetFlag('starter(client_extorted)')
#
o_text: You made the right choice.
o_id: right_choice
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: NegotiateFail
npc: (He laughs coldly.)
npc: You’ve got guts, but no brains. No more cash, choomba. Take the deal or walk.
+ I’m done negotiating.
#
o_text: You’ll regret this.
o_id: regret
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: CorporateSuccess
npc: (He straightens his collar, suddenly very polite.)
npc: A third party. Of course. I didn't realize this had gone that far up.
+ Tell your people the job is closed. No hard feelings, yeah?
effect: SetFlag('jacob_backed_off')
#
o_text: Smart man.
o_id: smart_man
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction
#
o_text: I'll pass that along.
o_id: pass_along
o_goto: End

name: CorporateFail
npc: (He looks you up and down and laughs.)
npc: Nice suit. It doesn't fit you, and neither does that story.
+ Nobody sent you. Now get out of my house.
#
o_text: Fine. We're done here.
o_id: corporate_done
o_goto: End
#
o_text: Wrong answer.
o_id: wrong_answer
o_goto: KillClient

name: End
npc: (He shuts the door behind you.)
effect: EndConversation

name: BetterJob
npc: (He studies you, then grins.)
npc: Real work. Fine. Some rich bastard is hiding up in a mansion outside the wall.
+ Nobody knows where exactly. Find it and there's more sat in it than this whole block has ever seen.
+ I'll send the details to your terminal.
effect: SetFlag('jacob_better_job')
#
o_text: I'll be in touch.
o_id: in_touch
o_goto: End

name: BackedOff
npc: (He flinches when he sees you.)
+ I told you, the Doc is off the table. What else do you want?
#
o_text: Nothing. Just checking.
o_id: just_checking
o_goto: End
#
o_text: Got any real work for someone like me?
o_id: ask_real_work_later
o_cond: !HasFlag('jacob_better_job')
o_goto: BetterJob
